NOTE ON DATA AND MODEL WEIGHTS

This licence covers the analysis code, figures, and derived result files in this
repository only. The source datasets (NIH ChestX-ray14, Kermany chest X-ray,
VinDr-CXR) and the pretrained model weights (torchxrayvision) are NOT covered
by this licence. They remain subject to their original terms of use and, in the
case of the NIH ChestX-ray14 dataset, to the NIH data distribution agreement.
